OL,3,GNEWSAFire safety review at Borders
OL,4,Aschools after blaze closes primary for
OL,5,Amonths
OL,6,
OL,7,FA major safety review will be carried
OL,8,Fout in all schools in the Scottish
OL,9,FBorders after a fire at a primary
OL,10,Fschool last month.
OL,12,FThe blaze at Newtown Primary, in Newton
OL,13,FSt Boswells, resulted in #240,000 in
OL,14,Fdamage with the school expected to
OL,15,Fremain closed for a further four months
OL,16,Ffor repairs.
OL,18,FA teenager has been charged over the
OL,19,Ffire, but it has emerged that doors
OL,20,Finside the building were left open
OL,21,Fwhich allowed smoke to spread
OL,22,Fextensively.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,429,420,260,160,0,100
