OL,3,GNEWSAFire safety review at Borders
OL,4,Aschools after blaze closes primary for
OL,5,Amonths
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe review - which will extend to all
OL,8,Fcouncil-owned facilities - will look at
OL,9,Ffire doors and the proximity of rubbish
OL,10,Fbins to buildings.
